<div class="callout-dark">
<h4 class="callout-dark__title">E-Commerce &amp; 3PL Facilities</h4>
<p class="callout-dark__body">The e-commerce boom is driving unprecedented warehouse construction — warehouses represent the single largest segment of commercial LED lighting at 25.4% market share. ALG's sensor-ready, quick-ship solutions are built for the speed and scale these projects demand. BAA/TAA compliance opens doors to government logistics and distribution facilities.</p>
